{"4214910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nuclear Engineer Tycoon", "steam_appid": 4214910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuclear Engineer Tycoon is a nuclear power plant building and management game. You will build reactors, turbines, pumps, batteries, and generators. Build pipes to move steam, water, and other fluids, and wires to move energy making reactors and turbines work. Earn money and research advanced and larger reactors. Keep the reactor safe and free from disasters; disasters are costly. Buy uranium to transform into fuel pellets. Treat nuclear waste, manage employees to automate your nuclear power plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/1f937716ef9a54c2db8e2340aacfca13.poster.avif?t=1788146121\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/1f937716ef9a54c2db8e2340aacfca13.webm?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/1f937716ef9a54c2db8e2340aacfca13.mp4?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a nuclear power plant and sell the energy to research new technologies and build more reactors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more land to increase your production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate processes with employees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine uranium for use in reactors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep reactors safe and prevent meltdowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research advanced nuclear technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve an energy monopoly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage nuclear waste and recycle it, generating more money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the world with clean and safe energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/01c3fa639acce031dbd1a1dd55dd1757.poster.avif?t=1788146121\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/01c3fa639acce031dbd1a1dd55dd1757.webm?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/01c3fa639acce031dbd1a1dd55dd1757.mp4?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different maps with areas for expansion and construction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/45436fdba0690b27cc648192e9b5bcb5.poster.avif?t=1788146121\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/45436fdba0690b27cc648192e9b5bcb5.webm?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/45436fdba0690b27cc648192e9b5bcb5.mp4?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuclear Engineer Tycoon is a nuclear power plant building and management game. You will build reactors, turbines, pumps, batteries, and generators. Build pipes to move steam, water, and other fluids, and wires to move energy making reactors and turbines work. Earn money and research advanced and larger reactors. Keep the reactor safe and free from disasters; disasters are costly. Buy uranium to transform into fuel pellets. Treat nuclear waste, manage employees to automate your nuclear power plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/1f937716ef9a54c2db8e2340aacfca13.poster.avif?t=1788146121\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/1f937716ef9a54c2db8e2340aacfca13.webm?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/1f937716ef9a54c2db8e2340aacfca13.mp4?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a nuclear power plant and sell the energy to research new technologies and build more reactors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more land to increase your production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate processes with employees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine uranium for use in reactors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep reactors safe and prevent meltdowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research advanced nuclear technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve an energy monopoly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage nuclear waste and recycle it, generating more money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the world with clean and safe energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/01c3fa639acce031dbd1a1dd55dd1757.poster.avif?t=1788146121\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/01c3fa639acce031dbd1a1dd55dd1757.webm?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/01c3fa639acce031dbd1a1dd55dd1757.mp4?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different maps with areas for expansion and construction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/45436fdba0690b27cc648192e9b5bcb5.poster.avif?t=1788146121\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/45436fdba0690b27cc648192e9b5bcb5.webm?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/extras/45436fdba0690b27cc648192e9b5bcb5.mp4?t=1788146121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build a nuclear power plant and manage reactors, generators, and turbines, producing energy to keep the city lit and prevent reactor explosions. Earn resources, research nuclear technologies, build larger and more modern reactors, refine uranium, and create a nuclear energy empire.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/499ca7147c72fefd8e614471fee3b01adc81c1b9/header.jpg?t=1788146121", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214910/8682cd50543504475b4561b8f91b0eecffa5cdce/capsule_231x8